d>\n<table align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody><tr height=\"5\" nowrap=\"\">\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr align=\"center\">\n<td align=\"left\" nowrap=\"\" style=\"word-break:break-all;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"60\"> <div>해오라기</div></td>\n<td align=\"left\" style=\"word-break:break-all;\" width=\"70%\"> 글자 그대로 지원을 해줬으면 좋겠군요 ^^*</td>\n<td align=\"center\" style=\"word-break:break-all;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"60\"><font class=\"allure2\"> <span title=\"2001년 09월 20일 16시 35분 08초\">2001/09/20</span></font></td>\n<td align=\"right\" valign=\"top\" width=\"10\"><a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20011123112357/http://forg.co.kr:80/zboard/del_comment.php?id=UO_Vote&amp;page=1&amp;page_num=2&amp;category=&amp;sn=off&amp;ss=on&amp;sc=on&amp;keyword=&amp;prev_no=&amp;select_arrange=headnum&amp;desc=asc&amp;no=58&amp;c_no=60\" target=\"_blank\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://forg.co.kr:80/zboard/skin/vote/secret_del.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing-slot.svg\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</td>\n<td width=\"15\">&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"100%\">\n<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td width=\"15\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td>\n<table align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody><tr height=\"5\" nowrap=\"\">\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr align=\"center\">\n<td align=\"left\" nowrap=\"\" style=\"word-break:break-all;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"60\"> <div>온초보</div></td>\n<td align=\"left\" style=\"word-break:break-all;\" width=\"70%\"> 알까기도 지원해주면 좋겠는데...\n </td>\n<td align=\"center\" style=\"word-break:break-all;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"60\"><font class=\"allure2\"> <span title=\"2001년 09월 25일 18시 12분 34초\">2001/09/25</span></font></td>\n<td align=\"right\" valign=\"top\" width=\"10\"><a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20011123112357/http://forg.co.kr:80/zboard/del_comment.php?id=UO_Vote&amp;page=1&amp;page_num=2&amp;category=&amp;sn=off&amp;ss=on&amp;sc=on&amp;keyword=&amp;prev_no=&amp;select_arrange=headnum&amp;desc=asc&amp;no=58&amp;c_no=61\" target=\"_blank\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://forg.co.kr:80/zboard/skin/vote/secret_del.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing-slot.svg\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</td>\n<td width=\"15\">&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"100%\">\n<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td width=\"15\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td>\n<table align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody><tr height=\"5\" nowrap=\"\">\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr align=\"center\">\n<td align=\"left\" nowrap=\"\" style=\"word-break:break-all;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"60\"><b> <a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20011123112357/http://forg.co.kr:80/zboard/mailform\" target=\"_blank\">Ingrid</a></b></td>\n<td align=\"left\" style=\"word-break:break-all;\" width=\"70%\"> 장기판..지원됫으면 재밋겟네요..&gt;_&lt;\n 아아 그리고 구경군들은 방해 못하게 하는것도..\n 추가되었으면!</td>\n<td align=\"center\" style=\"word-break:break-all;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"60\"><font class=\"allure2\"> <span title=\"2001년 10월 28일 18시 42분 02초\">2001/10/28</span></font></td>\n<td align=\"right\" valign=\"top\" width=\"10\">&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</td>\n<td width=\"15\">&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"100%\">\n<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td width=\"15\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td>\n<table align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody><tr height=\"5\" nowrap=\"\">\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr align=\"center\">\n<td align=\"left\" nowrap=\"\" style=\"word-break:break-all;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"60\"><b> <a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20011123112357/http://forg.co.kr:80/zboard/mailform\" target=\"_blank\">Avatar</a></b></td>\n<td align=\"left\" style=\"word-break:break-all;\" width=\"70%\"> 흐흐.. 구경꾼 문제는 우리가 해결해야될 문제인듯.. 잡넘은 확실히 기억했다가 왕따시키는 분위기가 조성되어야함.. 뛰어난 잡질러가 우상화 되는 분위기 보다는...</td>\n<td align=\"center\" style=\"word-break:break-all;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"60\"><font class=\"allure2\"> <span title=\"2001년 11월 09일 02시 54분 09초\">2001/11/09</span></font></td>\n<td align=\"right\" valign=\"top\" width=\"10\">&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</td>\n<td width=\"15\">&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"100%\">\n<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td width=\"15\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td>\n<table align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody><tr height=\"5\" nowrap=\"\">\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr align=\"center\">\n<td align=\"left\" nowrap=\"\" style=\"word-break:break-all;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"60\"><b> <a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20011123112357/http://forg.co.kr:80/zboard/mailform\" target=\"_blank\">윤</a></b></td>\n<td align=\"left\" style=\"word-break:break-all;\" width=\"70%\"> 알까기 지원하면 넷마블같은데 망할듯 -_-;;</td>\n<td align=\"center\" style=\"word-break:break-all;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"60\"><font class=\"allure2\"> <span title=\"2001년 11월 17일 22시 05분 39초\">2001/11/17</span></font></td>\n<td align=\"right\" valign=\"top\" width=\"10\">&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</td>\n<td width=\"15\">&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div align=\"center\">\n<table border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"90%\">\n<colgroup><col><col><col>\n</colgroup><tbody><tr>\n<td width=\"1\">\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n</td>\n<td align=\"right\">\n<br><br><img border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://forg.co.kr:80/zboard/skin/vote/t.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"1\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing-slot.svg\"><br><font align=\"left\" class=\"allure1\"><b>Write your comment</b></font